# label: alg:ch59-lookup
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch59.tex:141
# caption: Resolve a runtime reference under an explicitly supplied lookup policy.

REQUIRE name/version request, ordered lookup scope, platform eligibility and binding policy
ENSURE a permitted runtime definition or a policy-defined unresolved outcome
FORALL objects in the lookup scope's declared order DO
  query the object's dynamic symbol index for the requested name
  FORALL candidate entries DO
    check definition state, visibility, version, and permitted symbol kind
    IF the policy selects this eligible candidate THEN
      RETURN its runtime definition
    END IF
  END FOR
END FOR
apply the platform's missing-symbol rule for this reference

